{"text":"kuruntokai","n":87,"lines":["மன்ற மராஅத்த பேஎமுதிர் கடவுள்","கொடியோர்த் தெறூஉம் என்ப யாவதும்","கொடியர் அல்லரெங் குன்றுகெழு நாடர்","பசைஇப் பசந்தன்று நுதலே","ஞெகிழ ஞெகிழ்ந்தன்று தடமென் தோளே"],"tr":["maṉṟa marāatta pēemutir kaṭavuḷ","koṭiyōrt teṟūum eṉpa yāvatum","koṭiyar allareṅ kuṉṟukeḻu nāṭar","pacaiip pacantaṉṟu nutalē","ñekiḻa ñekiḻntaṉṟu taṭameṉ tōḷē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 5"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 10, āciriyattaḷai 5, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"மன்ற","tr":"maṉṟa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ற","tr":"ṟa"}]},{"text":"மராஅத்த","tr":"marāatta","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரா","tr":"marā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அத்","tr":"at"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"பேஎமுதிர்","tr":"pēemutir","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பே","tr":"pē"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"எமு","tr":"emu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"திர்","tr":"tir"}]},{"text":"கடவுள்","tr":"kaṭavuḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கட","tr":"kaṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வுள்","tr":"vuḷ"}]}],[{"text":"கொடியோர்த்","tr":"koṭiyōrt","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடி","tr":"koṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோர்த்","tr":"yōrt"}]},{"text":"தெறூஉம்","tr":"teṟūum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெறூ","tr":"teṟū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"உம்","tr":"um"}]},{"text":"என்ப","tr":"eṉpa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"என்","tr":"eṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ப","tr":"pa"}]},{"text":"யாவதும்","tr":"yāvatum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வதும்","tr":"vatum"}]}],[{"text":"கொடியர்","tr":"koṭiyar","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடி","tr":"koṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"அல்லரெங்","tr":"allareṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அல்","tr":"al"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லரெங்","tr":"lareṅ"}]},{"text":"குன்றுகெழு","tr":"kuṉṟukeḻu","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுகெ","tr":"ṟuke"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழு","tr":"ḻu"}]},{"text":"நாடர்","tr":"nāṭar","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டர்","tr":"ṭar"}]}],[{"text":"பசைஇப்","tr":"pacaiip","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசை","tr":"pacai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இப்","tr":"ip"}]},{"text":"பசந்தன்று","tr":"pacantaṉṟu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசந்","tr":"pacan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"நுதலே","tr":"nutalē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நுத","tr":"nuta"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லே","tr":"lē"}]}],[{"text":"ஞெகிழ","tr":"ñekiḻa","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஞெகி","tr":"ñeki"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ழ","tr":"ḻa"}]},{"text":"ஞெகிழ்ந்தன்று","tr":"ñekiḻntaṉṟu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஞெகிழ்ந்","tr":"ñekiḻn"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"தடமென்","tr":"taṭameṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தட","tr":"taṭa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மென்","tr":"meṉ"}]},{"text":"தோளே","tr":"tōḷē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"of the common ground"}],"gloss":"of the common ground","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மராஅத்த","parts":[{"text":"மராஅத்த","lemma":"மராஅத்த","gloss":"of the kadamba tree"}],"gloss":"of the kadamba tree","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பேஎமுதிர்","parts":[{"text":"பேஎம்","lemma":"pēem","gloss":"fear/spirit"},{"text":"முதிர்","lemma":"mutir","gloss":"mature/abundant"}],"gloss":"abounding in awe"},{"surface":"கடவுள்","parts":[{"text":"கடவுள்","lemma":"kaṭavuḷ","gloss":"deity"}],"gloss":"deity"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொடியோர்த்","parts":[{"text":"கொடியோர்த்","lemma":"கொடியோர்த்","gloss":"cruel people"}],"gloss":"cruel people","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தெறூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"தெறூஉம்","lemma":"தெறூஉம்","gloss":"will punish"}],"gloss":"will punish","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்ப","parts":[{"text":"என்ப","lemma":"eṉpa","gloss":"they say"}],"gloss":"they say"},{"surface":"யாவதும்","parts":[{"text":"யாவதும்","lemma":"yāvatum","gloss":"at all"}],"gloss":"at all"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொடியர்","parts":[{"text":"கொடியர்","lemma":"koṭiyar","gloss":"cruel person"}],"gloss":"a cruel person"},{"surface":"அல்லர்","parts":[{"text":"அல்லர்","lemma":"allar","gloss":"he is not"}],"gloss":"he is not"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"em","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"குன்றுகெழு","parts":[{"text":"குன்று","lemma":"kuṉṟu","gloss":"hill"},{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"hill-abounding"},{"surface":"நாடர்","parts":[{"text":"நாடர்","lemma":"nāṭar","gloss":"lord of the land"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பசைஇப்","parts":[{"text":"பசைஇப்","lemma":"பசைஇப்","gloss":"having loved"}],"gloss":"having loved","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பசந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"பசந்தன்று","lemma":"பசந்தன்று","gloss":"has turned pale"}],"gloss":"has turned pale","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நுதலே","parts":[{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"nutal","gloss":"forehead"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the forehead indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஞெகிழ","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழ்","lemma":"ñekiḻ","gloss":"become loose"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to become loose"},{"surface":"ஞெகிழ்ந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஞெகிழ்ந்தன்று","lemma":"ஞெகிழ்ந்தன்று","gloss":"has wasted away"}],"gloss":"has wasted away","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தடமென்","parts":[{"text":"தடமென்","lemma":"தடமென்","gloss":"large and soft"}],"gloss":"large and soft","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோளே","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"tōḷ","gloss":"shoulder"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the shoulders indeed"}]}],"literal":"Of the common ground kadamba tree, the awe-abounding deity / will punish cruel people, they say, at all. / A cruel person he is not, our hill-abounding land's lord. / Having loved, turned pale has the forehead. / To slip, wasted away have the large soft shoulders.","translation":"They say the awe-inspiring deity dwelling in the kadamba tree of the common ground will surely punish those who are cruel. But the lord of our hilly land is not cruel at all. Yet, because of my love for him, my forehead has turned pale, and my large, soft shoulders have wasted away, making my bangles slip.","modern":"மன்றத்தில் உள்ள கடம்ப மரத்தில் உறையும் அச்சம் தரும் தெய்வம் கொடியவர்களைத் தண்டிக்கும் என்று கூறுவார்கள். ஆனால், நம்முடைய மலைநாட்டின் தலைவரோ சிறிதும் கொடியவர் அல்லர். எனினும், அவர் மீது கொண்ட அன்பினால் என் நெற்றி பசலை நிறம் அடைந்தது; என் பெரிய மென்மையான தோள்களும் மெலிந்து வளையல்கள் கழலும்படி தளர்ந்துவிட்டன.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her confidante in her distress. People in the village believe that the deity residing in the sacred kadamba tree in the common ground punishes those who are cruel or unfaithful. The heroine defends her lover, the lord of the hills, insisting that he is not a cruel man. However, her physical state reveals her inner suffering: her forehead has turned pale with pining, and her shoulders have grown so thin that her bangles are slipping off. This contrast between her words of defense and her physical deterioration highlights her deep love and the pain of separation in the Kuriñci landscape.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.77],[1.77,2.1],[2.1,2.85],[2.85,3.2],[3.2,3.55],[3.55,3.9],[3.9,4.8],[4.8,5.1],[5.1,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.22],[6.22,7.0],[7.0,7.5],[7.75,8.0],[8.0,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,9.8]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.8],[1.8,2.5],[2.5,3.05],[3.48,3.7],[3.7,4.1],[4.1,4.3],[4.3,5.7],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,6.7],[6.7,7.2],[7.2,7.51],[7.51,8.6],[8.6,9.1],[9.1,9.25],[9.25,10.6],[10.6,11.3],[11.3,11.7]]}}